  "details": "So as you could gleam, for me- I don’t know why, don’t know how limited to me it is, because i tried uninstalling and reinstalling, and clearing both caches, but it wouldn’t work regardless. I cant recieve any invites, or at least- people can send me invites but they won’t appear for me. I did this on green and blue, so no its not blocking notifs, or something is. I checked the invite box and i still couldn’t see them. Its not just invites too, its been join requests, friend requests. But for some reason the remove player notification when someone calls a vote still goes through. The other issue is that my Social Tab wont update. The same friends stay on the tab in the same map they were when i first log in. Even if the lobby instance empties out completely it’ll still show them being there. If someone goes offline, it says they’re still online and vice versa. I cant join off other friends if they’re on orange even via the website because join requests are automatically turned off if anyone is on orange or a private world. Its been like this ever since two updates ago, yes, my drivers are up to date. And vrc is up to date. Im not sure what’s happening.",
